      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Unobtainable, but allows the player to change clothes anywhere.",
      "short_effect": "Unobtainable, but allows the player to change clothes anywhere.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "どんな　ファッションアイテムでも\nつめこんでおける　しゅうのうりょく\nばつぐんの　かるい　トランク。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "어떤 패션 아이템이라도\n담아둘 수 있고 가벼우며\n수납력이 뛰어난 트렁크.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能夠塞入各種時尚物品的\n收納能力極佳的輕箱子。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une valise extrêmement légère, parfaite pour\nstocker un grand nombre de vêtements et\nd’accessoires de mode.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein leichter und sehr hilfreicher Koffer mit so viel\nStauraum, dass jedes erdenkliche Kleidungsstück\nund Accessoire darin aufbewahrt werden kann.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Maleta ligera de increíble capacidad donde podrás\nguardar todas las prendas de ropa que quieras.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un baule leggero ma estremamente capiente che\npuò contenere qualsiasi capo d’abbigliamento.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A light and yet incredibly effective trunk, which can\ncontain every last piece of clothing that can\nbe bought.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "どんな　ファッションアイテムでも\n詰めこんでおける　収納力\n抜群の　軽い　トランク。",
